<class name="RailVehicleController" inherits="VehicleController" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		A railway vehicle.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		What [VehicleController] says of every vehicle, plus the railway's own: its cabs, couplers and trainset, the master controller and reverser, the relays, the low voltage, the battery and the converter, and the stepping [RailVehicleServer] runs it by. Railway components ([RailVehicleComponent]) belong to one of these.
	</description>
